{"parse": {"title": "7TH-14", "pageid": 55152, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-13\" title=\"7TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-15\" title=\"7TH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B9.B2.E6.B2.99.E7.B2.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"干沙粒\">干沙粒</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 干沙粒</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Sandstorm in a Room</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>应<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>喝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>彩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10714</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蒸汽活塞在地上旋转，像一个滑稽的陀螺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308622.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308622.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，这不是一个适合说话的姿态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308622.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308622.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-308622.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308622.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>希曼，可以把我装回去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人的助理匆匆走了过来，力所能及地对机器进行了修整。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——谢谢，我感觉好多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，你还为我挑选了有脸的形态，真贴心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-512901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我注意到你的眼神很严格，阿德勒研究员。你似乎渴望纠正这里的逻辑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>好的，刚刚那句话是出于礼貌。实际上，装入哪具躯壳对我而言没有区别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器不合时宜的人性化发言令研究员更为恼怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……为什么您不终止实验，露西女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>是您忽略了发生在这里的牺牲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>还是您和乌尔里希——你们这些装在铁皮里的意识唤醒者——根本就没有人命的概念？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>阿德勒·霍夫曼，我再次警告你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被提到名字的组长气冲冲地带着安全员走了进来，想把这颗不安分的螺栓按回原位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没关系，阿德勒研究员。你现有的偏执只是因为掌握信息不足，导致了程序上的判断错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我相信，你在充分了解情况后，也会做出最为理性的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>理性的判断！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以理性而闻名的人类夸张地喊了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>可我们不是机器，露西女士，我们也不是可供更换的零件！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我有充分的理由怀疑，您在研究推进上的一意孤行，只是神秘学家一种特殊的失控表现——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>实验已经被终止了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——除了这个房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器微笑了一下，似乎认为对方理应为这个回复而高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>正如你和兔毛手袋研究员之前提醒的，这个术式超越了绝大多数科算中心成员能力的限度。他们在术式生效前就会被副作用烧毁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>第一波传播是不可抗力，朵拉当时已经按下了发送键。后续传播则被及时拦截，无关人员也得到疏散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>现在参与实验的，只有少数签署了知情同意书的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>知情同意——是的，又是这个该死的词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——请原谅我引用您的论点，露西女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您的乐观只是因为推断能力的不足。我们面对的到底是什么东西？只是念几个音节，就会招致这样的诅咒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>既然您也知道那个“限度”，就应该让剩下的人也退出。这完全是白费力气，只会让牺牲上徒增牺牲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员恼怒地压下刺痛的神经，再度重复了自己已经在走廊上大声吼叫过一遍的观点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>破译组长显然也想再次说些反驳的话，但总负责人只是点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，你也许是正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——但是，正确又有什么用呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她露出了一个可称温和的笑容，但效果适得其反。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员一直很不喜欢这张假脸，它做出人情味的徒劳尝试反而更凸显了钢铁的无情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你刚刚说到“限度”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我很意外，竟然是你说出了这个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这几乎是人身攻击了，就连最擅此道的哑谜也为此意外了一秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们所知的历史里，新石器时代后物种的躯体变化速度已在逐步放缓。然而，与此同时，人类的文明却蓬勃发展，不断取得辉煌的成就。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这并非你们中的某个人突然获得了恒星般巨大的神力，而是整个群体不断协同的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>文明的发展，科技的突破，正在于我们一次又一次地超越限度。我们突破自身的桎梏，使用智慧和工具改造四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——也就是我们所说的，进步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……磅礴的漂亮话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>磅礴的漂亮话，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——该死，他忘了机器无疑也拥有卓越的听力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>现实如此，我们必须越过限度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们必须突破雨幕的桎梏，不然任何进步都无从谈起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>因此，全面了解术式副作用的种类和特性，是至关重要的第一步。它能为后续的消除工作提供数据基底，也能帮助更多人安全使用术式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……那谁有这个能力呢，尊敬的露西女士？我们可没有那么多条命来穷举。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>哦，其实多亏了乌尔里希先生，我们才从随机里找到了突破口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我想的确可以让其他神秘学家也回去了——只留下意识唤醒者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……意识唤醒者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灼眼的红色在钨丝上轻微地闪烁，随后房间的灯光明亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>露西女士，电力恢复了。可以开始实验了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，这场解释略有些冗长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请稍作等待，阿德勒研究员。我们还未达成理性的一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……什么？实验，在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罔顾他的惊讶，露西坐到了铁质的实验台前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯光亮起，她的身上接满了电路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仪器的辉光管随着蒸汽活塞的律动而亮起，这台机器将如实地把这位意识唤醒者的一切行为记录下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从最细微的旋转弧度，到可量化为电力的神秘术能量波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>La ünüa ...</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……什么，她要念咒？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>荒诞的举动令他惊愕，研究员徒劳地环顾起了实验室，不确定这是否是机器又一次语出惊人的尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——她看过那些副作用的报告，对吧？甚至朵拉碎掉的时候，她也在场！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她少见地蜷缩起了背部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那张往常用来挂着笑容的脸，也在此刻呈现出了事与愿违的情感传达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钢铁本不应该感到痛苦。机器没有躯体，也没有神经。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果这令她也感到不堪忍受——那到底是什么在折磨她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器也会被摧毁吗？她会以什么形式碎裂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“诅咒”正在虎视眈眈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如手持闪电的宙斯在高山上俯瞰着盗火者的挣扎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不行，希曼，我无法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>无法……再继续……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>呃、呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最原始的本能恐惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也是研究员第一次听到她的情感流露。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——混账，你们在等什么？！为什么还不终止实验？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的不安和惶恐震慑住了男人，他几乎就要冲上去拔掉电线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>她是科算中心的总负责人，如果她也停摆了，还有谁能担任这个位置！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>给我站好了，哑谜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长恶狠狠的声音从背后传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>这是你要进来的，这也是你要看的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div><b>还是说，你那人道主义的范围从来都如此狭窄，不包括除自己以外的任何一个物种？</b></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_luxiwangzuo2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实验台前，助理只是轻声地开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……您可以的，露西女士，这只是既定程式的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-516310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>您只要再坚持说出几个音节……这一切，就结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>既定、程式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恐惧褪去了几分，她感到宽慰地重复着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，我喜欢……这个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器闭上了眼睛。尽管她不由情感神经驱动——但她咬牙说出了最后的词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>Cir ... klo.</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于念完了所有的咒文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>震动均匀，发声正确，无可挑剔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实验室的灯光也在这一瞬间熄灭下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-308613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-308613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-308613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……呼，我念完了吗，希曼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-516301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-516301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-516301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗中，无人看见她的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那理应是一个微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，很好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一场未经预报的小型沙尘暴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无征兆，突如其来，在这个封闭的暗室之中呼啸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它卷走了那具冰冷的铁质躯体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，只有一个老旧的活塞从空中掉了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“——噔。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-14"}}